@startuml

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Node A" as A
participant "Node B" as B

== Periodic Liveness ==
loop Every heartbeat interval
  A -> B: PING(node_id, ts)
  B --> A: PONG(node_id, ts)
end

== Membership/Liveness Dissemination ==
A -> B: PEER_LIST(peers)
B -> A: PEER_LIST(peers)
opt State gossip
  A -> B: GOSSIP_STATE(state_delta)
end

note over A,B
Best-effort peer messaging over TCP.
Sender-side retry/queue may reduce transient loss.
No exactly-once or total-order guarantees.
end note

@enduml
